Package: idcheck
Title: Validate Identity Numbers and Check Digits
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Gaurav", "Sood", , "gsood07@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Tests whether strings are well-formed identity numbers, fast
    and vectorized over character vectors. The first release covers India:
    Aadhaar, Permanent Account Number, Goods and Services Tax
    Identification Number, voter identity card number, passport number and
    mobile number. The check-digit algorithms are exported on their own:
    Luhn, Verhoeff, Damm, and 'ISO/IEC 7064' MOD 11-2 and MOD 97-10.
    Malformed input returns FALSE rather than an error.
